        "prefix_token_count": 170,
        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "Step 3: Since the denominators are equal, we can equate the numerators:\n\n\\[\nC(x+8) + D(x-3) = 4x - 23\n\\]"
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 582,
