        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 234,
        "step_number": 4,
        "text": "Step 4: Expand and combine like terms on the left side:\n\n\\[\nCx + 8C + Dx - 3D = 4x - 23\n\\]\n\n\\[\n(C+D)x + (8C - 3D) = 4x - 23\n\\]"
      },
      {
